ading here.</p><br/></div>\n<p>On the way to the Medusa Cave you will meet a lot of <a href=\"#/wiki/Quara\">Quara Scouts</a> besides the creatures on the surface of <a href=\"#/wiki/Talahu\">Talahu</a>. Way to the Medusa Cave:\n</p><p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Route Medusa Cave\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"253\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Route_Medusa_Cave_540563.png\" width=\"564\"/></span>\n</p><p>The cave:\n</p><p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Medusa Cave Map\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"289\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Medusa_Cave_Map_c5cec5.png\" width=\"468\"/></span>\n</p></div>","quests":["killing-in-the-name-of-quest"]}